SOLUTION EXPECTATIONS

A web dashboard displaying detected risks with Al-generated mitigation plans; alert subscription and notification features; integration with external data APIs; performance metrics on detection accuracy and response time; demo includes scenario simulation and mitigation generation. Feel free to explore creative solutions that align with the problem context and objectives.
